  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the Pacific Regional Infrastructure Facility (PRIF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The EU contribution to PRIF intends to support the provision of technical advice to PRIF partners countries on themes such as:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;infrastructure plans and planning frameworks;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;infrastructure policy and regulatory advice;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;project implementation and coordination advice;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;infrastructure management advice, including asset management, maintenance, and budget frameworks;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;issues such as performance bench marking, project scoping, innovative technologies; and&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;private sector participation.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Overall Objective of this action is to contribute to improving the quality and coverage of infrastructure investments and service delivery in PRIF countries.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Specific Objectives of this action are:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;To improve the coordination of development partners&#xbf; investments in sustainable and more resilient infrastructure development and maintenance and maximise partnering and co-funding opportunities;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;To strengthen the capacity of the Pacific member countries in terms of infrastructure planning and management and facilitate the creation of a conducive environment for private sector participation;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;To identify best practices and improve information and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Outputs to be delivered by this action contributing to the corresponding Specific Objectives are:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contributing to Outcome 1 (or Specific Objective 1) &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1.1 Development partners&#xbf; pipelines are regularly updated and shared;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1.2 Development partners coordination meetings are organized;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1.3 PRIF technical assistance for effective decision-making is identified and prioritized by development partners.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contributing to Outcome 2 (or Specific Objective 2)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2.1 PRIF members benefit from technical assistance and capacity building facility;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2.2 Pacific countries National Infrastructure Investment Plan (NIIP) are available and progress monitored.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contributing to Outcome 3 (or Specific Objective 3) &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3.1 Communications and Outreach Strategy implemented;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3.2 Knowledge products disseminated;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3.3 Community of Practice initiative is implemented.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
